<title>USA: U.S. rev Q3 corporate profits fell 1.4 pct.</title>
<headline>U.S. rev Q3 corporate profits fell 1.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Department revised estimates of third quarter profits by U.S. corporations, with comparisons. Profits before tax include inventory valuation and capital consumption adjustments.</p>
<p>Data are chain weighted and expressed in seasonally adjusted annual rates of billions of dollars, with third quarter percent changes from the second quarter.</p>
<p> -		  Pct--Q3'96-(Prev)--Q2'96---1995</p>
<p>-  After Tax  -1.4  402.2  397.5  408.1  380.2 -  Before Tax  0.8  661.2  654.7  655.8  586.6 Tax Liability -1.3  233.4  231.4  236.4  218.7</p>
